        "excerpt": "Comparison of AI blog generators against traditional ghostwriting services and human in-house content teams for cost, speed, and technical accuracy.",
        "content": "<h2>AI vs. Human: The Content Scaling Debate</h2>\n\n<p>When faced with the need to scale a technical blog (like generating 210 articles), content creators must weigh AI generators against traditional alternatives: hiring human writers or outsourcing to a content agency. The answer lies in the required volume, speed, and complexity of the topic.</p>\n\n<h3>I. AI Blog Post Generators (e.g., Ollama)</h3>\n\n<h4>A. Pros</h4>\n\n<ul><li><strong>Speed:</strong> Instant, high-volume draft generation (ideal for generating 210 articles in a short timeframe).</li><li><strong>Cost:</strong> Minimal operational cost after initial setup (no per-word fee).</li><li><strong>Structure:</strong> Excellent at adhering to technical constraints (JSON, Schema, Headings).</li></ul>\n<h4>B. Cons</h4>\n\n<ul><li><strong>Factual Verification:</strong> Requires mandatory human review to eliminate inaccuracies (hallucinations).</li><li><strong>Originality:</strong> Risk of generic language if the prompt is not specific enough.</li></ul>\n<h3>II. Human Ghostwriters</h3>\n\n<h4>A. Pros</h4>\n\n<ul><li><strong>Accuracy:</strong> High factual accuracy, especially if the writer is a domain expert.</li><li><strong>Nuance:</strong> Better at incorporating subtle brand voice and subjective analysis.</li></ul>\n<h4>B. Cons</h4>\n\n<ul><li><strong>Speed:</strong> Very slow scaling (a 1500-word technical article can take days).</li><li><strong>Cost:</strong> High per-word cost.</li></ul>\n<h3>III. Content Agencies</h3>\n\n<h4>A. Pros</h4>\n\n<ul><li><strong>Management:</strong> Full project management, freeing up internal team resources.</li></ul>\n<h4>B. Cons</h4>\n\n<ul><li><strong>Cost:</strong> Highest overall cost.</li><li><strong>Technical Depth:</strong> Often rely on non-expert writers, increasing the need for technical fact-checking by your internal team.</li></ul>\n<strong>Verdict:</strong> For scaling technical, structured content around specific tools (like Doodax), a high-quality <strong>AI generator managed by an expert prompter</strong> (you) offers the best balance of speed, scalability, and cost efficiency, provided you prioritize the mandatory human verification step.",
