                "answer": "To ensure consistency, provide the team with a strict set of image optimization guidelines (e.g., 'All large images must be $80%$ quality $\text{JPEG}$ and $1600 \text{ px}$ wide'). The client-side optimizer ensures these rules are easily followed."
