                "question": "Does my CPU affect the speed test result?",
                "answer": "Yes. Very old or low-power $\text{CPUs}$ may struggle with the intense processing required to saturate a fast network connection (e.g., $1 \text{ Gbps}$). A strong $\text{CPU}$ is required to utilize maximum bandwidth."
