                "question": "Is it okay to use percentage change for long time periods?",
                "answer": "Yes, but you should use the $\text{Annualized}$ $\text{Percentage}$ $\text{Change}$ for comparison. Comparing $\text{10}$-$\text{year}$ growth to $\text{1}$-$\text{year}$ growth is meaningless without standardizing the time period."
