                "question": "Can I request the same random image multiple times?",
                "answer": "Yes. Most fetchers allow you to add a unique seed number to the $\text{URL}$ ($\text{e.g.}$, $\text{/400/300?seed=123}$). Using the same seed number guarantees the same image is returned, providing visual consistency during testing."
